# pme, the pixmap editor (ipl_gprogs): paint with each of the three buttons, change the left colour through its prompt window, paint with the new
# colour, save the pixmap under a typed name, quit. The grid's cell x y stands at 70+8x 8y; the three ovals of the mouse picture are the colours.
click 1 110 20
wait
drag 2 150 100 220 100
wait
click 3 110 60
wait
# the left oval: a one-line window opens at 0 0 and reads a colour name
click 1 15 110
wait
move 20 6
type yellow
key Return
wait
click 1 126 20
wait
# S always asks a file name, in a window that opens under the pointer
key S
wait
type t
key Return
wait
key q
